# Release 1B Round 21 — Integrity Manifest
# Format: SHA256<two spaces>FILENAME (shasum -a 256 --check compatible)
# Non-recursive: this file does not cover itself.
#
# IMPORTANT: SHA-256 values must be computed after receiving the package.
# The AI tool environment has no shell execution capability and cannot
# compute SHA-256 hashes. Byte counts from the write tool are provided
# as supplementary evidence in the delivery message.
#
# To populate this file (run once, from the release1b_round21/ directory):
#
#   cd release1b_round21
#   shasum -a 256 \
#     release1b_cp0.zsh \
#     release1b_otp_test_adapter.pb.js \
#     release1b_cp0_manifest.json \
#     release1b_schema_manifest.json \
#     release1b_hook_manifest.json \
#     release1b_test_manifest.json \
#     release1b_operator_instructions.md \
#     release1b_round21_review.md \
#     > release1b_r21_checksums.sha256
#
# To verify (any time after population):
#
#   cd release1b_round21
#   shasum -a 256 --check release1b_r21_checksums.sha256
#
# The checksums file's own SHA-256 and byte count are provided
# separately in the delivery message.
#
# File count: 8 (all R21 artifacts except this checksums file).
# Expected output from --check: 8 lines, all "OK".
#
# A verifier script is not provided separately; shasum --check
# is the standard mechanism and exits nonzero on any mismatch.
#
# Byte counts observed at write time (supplementary; verify via wc -c):
#   release1b_cp0.zsh                  122061
#   release1b_otp_test_adapter.pb.js    14474
#   release1b_cp0_manifest.json         (see delivery message)
#   release1b_schema_manifest.json      (see delivery message)
#   release1b_hook_manifest.json        (see delivery message)
#   release1b_test_manifest.json        (see delivery message)
#   release1b_operator_instructions.md  (see delivery message)
#   release1b_round21_review.md         (see delivery message)
SHA256_COMPUTE_REQUIRED  release1b_cp0.zsh
SHA256_COMPUTE_REQUIRED  release1b_otp_test_adapter.pb.js
SHA256_COMPUTE_REQUIRED  release1b_cp0_manifest.json
SHA256_COMPUTE_REQUIRED  release1b_schema_manifest.json
SHA256_COMPUTE_REQUIRED  release1b_hook_manifest.json
SHA256_COMPUTE_REQUIRED  release1b_test_manifest.json
SHA256_COMPUTE_REQUIRED  release1b_operator_instructions.md
SHA256_COMPUTE_REQUIRED  release1b_round21_review.md
